contentText:
Leigh-Anne Pinnock is about to enter her era as a mother of three.

The Little Mix member and solo artist made the announcement about this new chapter with her husband, professional soccer player Andre Gray. On her social media , Pinnock shared the heartfelt news with an emotional video.&nbsp;

